{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission is simple: Investigate a seabound anomaly. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore key locations</strong>, <strong>gather clues</strong>, <strong>piece together evidence</strong> \u2014 and <strong>contain the threat</strong> before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/85ffbd07f47a81cc1ef2bccb117680a3.poster.avif?t=1763687383\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/85ffbd07f47a81cc1ef2bccb117680a3.webm?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/85ffbd07f47a81cc1ef2bccb117680a3.mp4?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong> \u2014 now reduced to a single warship, but still respected and feared. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you are in charge of leading this investigative operation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your<strong> primary goal:</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search designated Areas of Interest.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather evidence.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow any lead that might uncover the anomaly.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>four locations, many clues </strong>to find \u2014 but only <strong>three days</strong> to finish the mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/6d012e49de6d1b610f9b5dd0f6dfaf5f.poster.avif?t=1763687383\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/6d012e49de6d1b610f9b5dd0f6dfaf5f.webm?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/6d012e49de6d1b610f9b5dd0f6dfaf5f.mp4?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Anything you overlook may never be found again.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Choose carefully.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/601bdb0012e14dd16096ebb000f97176.poster.avif?t=1763687383\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/601bdb0012e14dd16096ebb000f97176.webm?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/601bdb0012e14dd16096ebb000f97176.mp4?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore, gather clues, </strong>and <strong>connect the evidence </strong>to <strong>uncover the truth.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.poster.avif?t=1763687383\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.webm?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.mp4?t=1763687383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1763687383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3703340?t=1763687383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/39f8dc6dc9fecfc0b8db12391737311704ccc3ca/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763687383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/39f8dc6dc9fecfc0b8db12391737311704ccc3ca/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763687383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes 2D depictions of violence, scenes involving corpses, and a generally tense atmosphere with potentially disturbing content. "},"demos":[{"appid":3789550,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your mission is simple: Investigate a seabound anomaly. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore key locations</strong>, <strong>gather clues</strong>, <strong>piece together evidence</strong> \u2014 and <strong>contain the threat</strong> before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/85ffbd07f47a81cc1ef2bccb117680a3.poster.avif?t=1763687383\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as